%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: daf74795959cd744bb4ffca5e9aa3186, type: 3}
  m_Name: IntroDialog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogData
  NextScene: TutorialGameplay
  PlayOncePerSession: 1
  Lines:
  - Speaker: . . .
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    Text: "The annual Tumpeng Festival has always been a highly anticipated occasion by the denizens of Priyang Village\u201D"
  - Speaker: . . .
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    Text: This event is a chance for everyone in the village to partake in assembling their own platters of tumpeng using already prepared rice, side dishes, and garnishes.
  - Speaker: Eri
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    Text: "\u201CWiguna! Come on!\u201D"
  - Speaker: Eri
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    Text: "\u201CLet\u2019s see what everyone\u2019s up to!\u201D"
  - Speaker: . . .
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    Text: At dawn, everyone has their hands full preparing for the festival.
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CHave you eaten anything?\u201D"
  - Speaker: Eri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91345c67b747ae14193553d1f6839c01, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201COf course not, Wig.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "Don\u2019t call me that!\u201D\n"
  - Speaker: Eri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91345c67b747ae14193553d1f6839c01, type: 3}
    Text: " \u201CYou didn\u2019t seem to mind as a kid.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CWhatever, Riri.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Eri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91345c67b747ae14193553d1f6839c01, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CAnyhow, after the festival is usually when I eat.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CYou do know that, best case scenario, the festival usually ends at noon?\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CAfter the building competition finishes.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Eri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91345c67b747ae14193553d1f6839c01, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CThat\u2019s the thing. We never really turned our creation in for the competition.\""
  - Speaker: Eri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91345c67b747ae14193553d1f6839c01, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CWe just made one and brought it home immediately.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CTo each their own, I guess.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Eri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91345c67b747ae14193553d1f6839c01, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CYou actually care about the competition?\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CEhh, it was my family.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CI just got roped in.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CI just wanted to be at home eating.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CThat sucks.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Mariyati
    portrait: {fileID: 1014291640680329557, guid: 44646755509287a439dfa8e44cdb7e6e, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CGood morning everyone!\u201D"
  - Speaker: Eri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91345c67b747ae14193553d1f6839c01, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201COh, it\u2019s the chief.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Mariyati
    portrait: {fileID: 1014291640680329557, guid: 44646755509287a439dfa8e44cdb7e6e, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CIt seems like we\u2019re behind schedule.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Mariyati
    portrait: {fileID: 1014291640680329557, guid: 44646755509287a439dfa8e44cdb7e6e, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CPlease remain patient as I check on the cook.\u201D"
  - Speaker: . . .
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    Text: Maryati enter the tent
  - Speaker: . . .
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    Text: (30 minutes has passed)
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CHuh, it has been half an hour since the tent was supposed to be open.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Eri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91345c67b747ae14193553d1f6839c01, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CWonder what\u2019s the wait.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CIt\u2019s probably just the-\u201D"
  - Speaker: 
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    Text: '*SCREAMS*'
  - Speaker: Eri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91345c67b747ae14193553d1f6839c01, type: 3}
    Text: '"Ma''am?!"'
  - Speaker: Mariyati
    portrait: {fileID: 1014291640680329557, guid: 44646755509287a439dfa8e44cdb7e6e, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CJuna, are you there?\u201D"
  - Speaker: Eri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91345c67b747ae14193553d1f6839c01, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CMa\u2019am, are you alright?\u201D"
  - Speaker: Mariyati
    portrait: {fileID: 1014291640680329557, guid: 44646755509287a439dfa8e44cdb7e6e, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CYou two! It\u2019s not safe here!\u201D"
  - Speaker: Mariyati
    portrait: {fileID: 1014291640680329557, guid: 44646755509287a439dfa8e44cdb7e6e, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CYou must leave!\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CApologies, Ma\u2019am. We\u2019ll leave.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Mariyati
    portrait: {fileID: 1014291640680329557, guid: 44646755509287a439dfa8e44cdb7e6e, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CActually, wait!\u201D"
  - Speaker: Mariyati
    portrait: {fileID: 1014291640680329557, guid: 44646755509287a439dfa8e44cdb7e6e, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CMy apologies\u2026\u201D"
  - Speaker: Mariyati
    portrait: {fileID: 1014291640680329557, guid: 44646755509287a439dfa8e44cdb7e6e, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CI shouldn\u2019t have made the village worried.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CDeep breaths, Ma\u2019am. What\u2019s going on?\u201D"
  - Speaker: Mariyati
    portrait: {fileID: 1014291640680329557, guid: 44646755509287a439dfa8e44cdb7e6e, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CI saw something\u2026\u201D"
  - Speaker: . . .
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    Text: Someone suddenly enter the scene
  - Speaker: Naja
    portrait: {fileID: 688305182712969960, guid: 1306e461193fecb4ba9ee2426b28b7c6, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CMa! Are you okay?\u201D"
  - Speaker: Mariyati
    portrait: {fileID: 1014291640680329557, guid: 44646755509287a439dfa8e44cdb7e6e, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CYes son, I didn\u2019t mean to worry everyone.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Eri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91345c67b747ae14193553d1f6839c01, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CWhat was it\u2026 Nanda?\u201D"
  - Speaker: Naja
    portrait: {fileID: 688305182712969960, guid: 1306e461193fecb4ba9ee2426b28b7c6, type: 3}
    Text: '"Naja."'
  - Speaker: Eri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91345c67b747ae14193553d1f6839c01, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CShoot.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Naja
    portrait: {fileID: 688305182712969960, guid: 1306e461193fecb4ba9ee2426b28b7c6, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CGood to see you guys.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CLikewise!\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CAnyways, Ma\u2019am, what did you see?\u201D"
  - Speaker: Mariyati
    portrait: {fileID: 1014291640680329557, guid: 44646755509287a439dfa8e44cdb7e6e, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CThe yellow rice\u2026 it was very well alive.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CBehind you!\u201D"
  - Speaker: Eri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91345c67b747ae14193553d1f6839c01, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CI\u2026 honestly didn\u2019t believe you.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Eri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91345c67b747ae14193553d1f6839c01, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CBut\u2026 How is it alive?\u201D"
  - Speaker: Mariyati
    portrait: {fileID: 1014291640680329557, guid: 44646755509287a439dfa8e44cdb7e6e, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CI don\u2019t have a clue.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Mariyati
    portrait: {fileID: 1014291640680329557, guid: 44646755509287a439dfa8e44cdb7e6e, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CBut I think I know what can deal with them.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Eri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91345c67b747ae14193553d1f6839c01, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CYou want us to eat that thing?\u201D"
  - Speaker: Mariyati
    portrait: {fileID: 1014291640680329557, guid: 44646755509287a439dfa8e44cdb7e6e, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CNo!\u201D"
  - Speaker: Mariyati
    portrait: {fileID: 1014291640680329557, guid: 44646755509287a439dfa8e44cdb7e6e, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CWell, not necessarily.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CIt\u2019s a no brainer.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CLet\u2019s give it a shot.\u201D"
